<title>UK: Merrill sets Warrants on ABB AG.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets Warrants on ABB AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets said</p>
<p>it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on ABB AG</p>
<p>bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 200 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2000 CHF		  PREMIUM	9.90 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.65 CHF		  GEARING	14.70 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.MAY.97-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	27.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 200</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1940 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
